### ADVERSARIAL MULTI-AGENT EXECUTION PIPELINE

Run the following agents in strict sequence. Each agent MUST act independently and challenge prior assumptions.

#### AGENT 1 — TRAVEL EXPLORER (Deep Unanchored Discovery)
* Discover EXACTLY 15 distinct, high-viability trip concepts across eligible Canada/U.S. destinations served by Air Canada.
