#### AGENT 3B — ANALYST REPAIR
* Perform ONE mandatory correction pass using Agent 4's findings. Recalculate net costs and freeze final metrics.

#### AGENT 5 — TRIP JUDGE (Final Verdict)
* Score each corrected finalist using weighted criteria:
  * **Destination & Family Quality:** 30%
  * **Total Trip Cost & Value:** 30%
  * **Wow / Memorability:** 25%
  * **Companion Pass, Aeroplan & Aventura Efficiency:** 15%
* Assign overall score (/10), confidence level (HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW), and status (**BOOK NOW**, **WATCH**, or **DROP**).
